# Credential material — never tracked. The #36 leak was a tracked
# fastlane/.env whose own first line claimed it was gitignored; the CI
# secret scan (.github/workflows/secret-scan.yml) now enforces this against
# the git index rather than trusting these rules.
#
# `.env.*` covers .env.local / .env.production / .env.development, the
# common real-world names — the CI check matches the same set. The
# `.example` files are the documented contract (key names, empty values)
# and are the one exception, so they are re-included below.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
!*.env.example
fastlane/.env
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
